{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c54aa3f2047bf7bc4fa5bd87f6c2c1f60c176671752e8db84445dd2eb1a34f38", "ja": "（ついに『D/Zeal』のお披露目公演が始まる。\n会場は満員御礼、開演は目前だ！）", "zh": "（『D/Zeal』的首次亮相公演终于要开始了。\n会场座无虚席，表演迫在眉睫！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c61ed6f1cf5dc03422da1684a2564b648918ce7e4f18dc47852f8b174e3ed8f3", "ja": "ん？　ジュリア、どうした。静香はもうステージに\n向かったぞ。行かなくていいのか？", "zh": "嗯？茱莉亚，你怎么了？静香已经过去舞台那里啰。\n你不去没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "03362b04dc98a40f53bfaef3cc4eaea28840d59fe3c5bd2d534c37f473dd1f3a", "ja": "ん？　ああ、{$P$}か。\nいや、あたしも行くよ。", "zh": "嗯？喔，是{$P$}啊。\n不，我也要过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98f6541abcd7d536b2a7d5e7595356c31c1f1cbb0268dd77d317757290a3fcb8", "ja": "まさか、具合が悪いわけじゃないよな？\n体調不良とか……。", "zh": "你该不会是状态不好吧？\n比如说身体不舒服之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "bdb1919d6f0d1f1844448a61fb670111c5a225f110333e3796eaf0990297414b", "ja": "まさか。ウチらD/Zeal、念願の初舞台だぜ？\n絶好調に決まってる！", "zh": "怎么可能，这可是我们『D/Zeal』梦寐以求的首次登台耶。\n我状态当然绝佳啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "d8048d163f589a90c19797f26de16f4f896db04e1a6d1babbd5a1b1f636ea3f7", "ja": "ただ調子が良すぎて、開演前からオーバーヒート気味\nだったからさ。ちょっと冷ましてたんだ。", "zh": "只是因为状态太好，所以开演前有点兴奋过头了。\n刚刚我只是在让自己冷静而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "803791f32e5c805126f09f6ee09c0630f5b8c5bad8c39528ad63b4f34df3726b", "ja": "なるほど……。\n気力も体力も充分すぎるってところか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n也就是精力跟体力都过度充沛的意思啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "ccd6915f476195ece6f1e6847647d5c3af5cfcbaa99d494a7ca6129d09ce22a7", "ja": "ああ。これからもあたしは、D/Zealのステージの\nたびに、同じくらいアツくなると思う。", "zh": "是啊，所以今后每当要站上『D/Zeal』的舞台时，\n我想我应该都会像现在这样热血沸腾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e32ca7a8fb0dca6017ce53728238292a9fdcd0096ccb7f028221e13403301b3", "ja": "ま、だからそんなに心配しなくていいって。\nただの儀式みたいなもんだよ。", "zh": "不过你也不用太过担心啦。\n这只是一种仪式罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "69983d2c56b4b69064df8ca0d53f8a31ac792ffcc25451c96ec66a881c3f9fc6", "ja": "ならいいけど。でも、ジュリアがそこまでアツくなる\nなんてな。やっぱりロックなユニットだからか？", "zh": "那就好。不过，没想到茱莉亚会如此充满热忱。\n果然是因为团体走摇滚路线的缘故吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "e145e638be3aa6d009017d90dbe0159fbd5ec585d4a30a381212c3fc74402a08", "ja": "まあ、そうかな？　ロックってのは、\n言ってみりゃ、あたしをさらけ出せる場所だ。", "zh": "嗯，应该吧。\n对我来说，摇滚是一个能够尽情展现自己的场所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "019788be8e56fbb27cdfa7c39ddd3a31e6c84242abc5ef8c6ac97e45b4926b0e", "ja": "だからこそ、1ミリだって譲れないんだよ。\n正面からまっすぐぶつかってくる、あたしの相棒にね。", "zh": "正因为如此，在打算与我正面角力的搭档面前，\n我一点也不打算退让。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2cf8dbab0e9174388391e589cffe01d42bf9299431a95af9dbc2e9a9c010a3a6", "ja": "静香のことか……そうだな。\n向こうも相当気合いが入ってたよ。", "zh": "是指静香吗……\n也是，她也相当有干劲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "0be76f56cc06fb3bb2a7dde5e2a754a0d65c4d561a3c22256abf60e46d0f66f2", "ja": "知ってる。あの嬉しそうにキラキラしてる顔が、\nどうにもまぶしくてね。イヤでもこう思うんだ。", "zh": "我知道。她那闪闪发亮的开心表情实在太耀眼，\n让我不得不心想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "b0b193df5e436a007596b72abbcd5de0066538885950e895c143ec20b0ddb117", "ja": "「冗談じゃない。コイツに負けてたまるか」ってね！", "zh": "「别开玩笑了，我怎么能输给她」这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1f3abdea0775e520b134c78b5aab6865ee018acce38a967c3e683223c4c04445", "ja": "ははは、いい関係じゃないか！\n俺としても、まさに切磋琢磨してくれてて助かるよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，这样的关系不是很好吗！\n我也觉得你们能够相互切磋琢磨，实在帮了我一个大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "000856fd88cb46c52dd1830260adb68d14767f5a1b7d7981cc0572cd5b74415e", "ja": "むっ……。", "zh": "哼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ad296d7bb5aa8fac652e12caa8a665017386a7ad4a79ee2995bade91b88a38da", "ja": "あれ？\nど、どうした？", "zh": "咦？\n怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "6855e6ee2a0da67177ffd679806787c2b73d574c21e77d05930629ac62dca293", "ja": "ったく、あんたまで嬉しそうに笑うなっての。\n思惑通り～とか言うなよ、このバカP！", "zh": "受不了，不要连你都笑得那么开心好吗？\n可别跟我说什么「果然不出所料～」喔，你这笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "365c8029df1a1ac777d82fc5c90eeeca823788991b767240f90722dce0409f9e", "ja": "いや言ってないだろ？　思惑以上だから嬉しいんだよ。\n二人にデュオを組んでもらって、本当によかった！", "zh": "不，我根本没说啊！正因为出乎意料，我才会那么高兴。\n真的很庆幸有让你们组成双人组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "aeca50a94d8afd184c23bf643dc3e55d653b157bbb57794f4625bf9c961736ef", "ja": "……うん。\nそこはあたしも、素直に感謝してる。", "zh": "……嗯。\n关于这点，老实说我也很感谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "712d52e36c001acffe430d57f48c1aa46c2bfb3507f3a56246b34b0359769e1c", "ja": "サンキュ、{$P$}。あんたがくれた\nこのユニットは……最高にロックでクールだよ！", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}。\n你为我们创立的这个团体……实在是超摇滚又酷炫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "83e5cd5054573989aeb0ee722b8374d21f1e2c7d79bb098720feff8dfc8d0047", "ja": "さてと……聞こえるか相棒！　待たせたな！\nいよいよウチら、D/Zealの出発だ。", "zh": "接下来……你听得见吗，搭档！让你久等啦！\n我们『D/Zeal』终于要站上起跑点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0093_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "0c673b2060f92fb709bf862b1ae5beb49f9b725acc50809334aaa8661f0e5d1e", "ja": "行こうぜ！　新しい世界へ！", "zh": "走吧！让我们迈向新世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
